# SPCR Git Attributes — Cross-Platform Line Ending Consistency
# Ensures LF line endings across Windows, Linux CI, and Render environments.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary files that must not undergo line conversion
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.onnx binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.db binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

